  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Instruments for climate change mitigation in Chile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Project are to provide technical assistance to the Beneficiary in the design and implementation of a Monitoring, Reporting and Verification (MRV) framework and registry, and the design and preparation of one or more carbon pricing instruments in the energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
